  "value": "teleporters is a list of \"from,to\" strings, dieSides >= 1, 0 <= currentSquare < lastSquare. For each roll r in 1..dieSides, the turn ends at lastSquare when currentSquare + r >= lastSquare, otherwise at the teleporter destination of the landing square if it has one, otherwise on the landing square. Return the distinct end squares of one turn in ascending order.",
